\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Can anyone make a suggestion on how to solve this?<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">thanks in adavance<u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u> <u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Pablo <u></u><u></u></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>"
